{"id":"n85184-1-8","stage":4,"title":"행적 · 行迹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85184-1-8-1","ko":"지난 일주일 동안의 행적을 자세히 말씀해 주시죠.","zh":"请详细说说您过去一周的行踪吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"일주일","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}},{"text":"동안의","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안의","audio":"/audio/00c94ff5db32ea590ead.mp3"}},{"text":"행적을","meaning":"行迹，去向，踪迹","explanation":"행적：行迹，去向，踪迹；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"행적","audio":"/audio/40d5276578518abc4106.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85184","senseId":"1","lemma":"행적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행적을","audio":"/audio/b5c54407b952a3a7e84b.mp3"}},{"text":"자세히","meaning":"仔细地，详细地","explanation":"자세히：仔细地，详细地","readings":[{"term":"자세히","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71196","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자세히","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀해","meaning":"说，说话","explanation":"말씀하다：说，说话；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"말씀하다","audio":"/audio/e90996cf12d134d920d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17200","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀해","audio":"/audio/67dd39d9cd1668844d9a.mp3"}},{"text":"주시죠.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주시죠","audio":"/audio/c1cf079b0dcf86473ed2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"40d5276578518abc","term":"행적","zh":"行迹，去向，踪迹","audio":"/audio/40d5276578518abc4106.mp3","entryId":"85184","definition":"做某种行为后留下的标记或痕迹。","pronunciation":["행적"]},{"id":"a072ebb77d96a166","term":"자세히","zh":"仔细地，详细地","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3","entryId":"71196","definition":"连很细小的部分都具体而明确地。","pronunciation":["자세히"]},{"id":"e90996cf12d134d9","term":"말씀하다","zh":"说，说话","audio":"/audio/e90996cf12d134d920d4.mp3","entryId":"17200","definition":"(尊称)讲话。","pronunciation":["말ː씀하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/96ed3b04300740823175.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85184-1-8-2","ko":"기억이 잘 안 나는데요.","zh":"我不太记得了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기억이","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억이","audio":"/audio/3e1df3e1fc3b5f222699.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나는데요.","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는데요","audio":"/audio/841b90695b7601fb60e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"603669bd762779d9","term":"기억","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3","entryId":"38812","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기억"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/48a3055ad8d0e796e3c0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.122,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85184","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/li